<title>UK: Energy Group disappointed with MMC inquiry.</title>
<headline>Energy Group disappointed with MMC inquiry.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy Group Plc said it was &quot;surprised and  disappointed&quot; the UK government had ordered an inquiry into PacifiCorp's  friendly bid for the British coal and electricity group.</p>
<p>Energy Group said it had not expected a referral to the Monopolies  and Mergers Commission (MMC) because PacifiCorp had indicated its  willingness to comply with all assurances required by the UK regulatory  authorities.</p>
<p>Energy Group said it would co-operate with the MMC, while it would  continue its strategy &quot;...to become one of the world's leading energy  suppliers.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom + 44 171 542 7717</p>
